SUMMARY:Shaping LGBTQ+ History: A Family Tour and Workshop
LOCATION:Green-Wood Cemetery\, Green-Wood Cemetery
DESCRIPTION:<p>Green-Wood has partnered with History UnErased to bring fami
 
lies together to learn about LGBTQ+ historical figures memorialized at Gree
 
n-Wood\, then create their own clay art inspired by them. Together we\\'ll 
 
introduce families to queer representation in history and the arts\, model 
 
age-appropriate Tickets & info: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/shaping-lgbtq-
 
history-a-family-tour-and-workshop-tickets-1995688856091
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/shaping-lgbtq-history-a-family-tour-and-wo
 
rkshop-tickets-1995688856091
